# File and Hash Threat Intelligence Analysis

## Project Overview

I Completed the File and Hash Threat Intelligence room on TryHackMe, focusing on the enrichment and investigation of suspicious files and 
hash artifacts using threat intelligence techniques. The project demonstrates the workflow used by Security Operations Center (SOC) 
analysts to validate evidence, investigate unknown binaries, identify indicators of compromise (IOCs), and produce actionable intelligence
reports.

## Objectives

* Validate file and hash artifacts before analysis.
* Perform static and behavioral analysis of suspicious files.
* Enrich indicators using threat intelligence sources.
* Identify malicious behaviors and attack techniques.
* Generate intelligence reports with evidence-based recommendations.


